== Description ==

'''Chrome Ingot''' is a refined metal ingot in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Furnace]]. It appears as an ingredient in 24 downstream recipes at 3 different workbenches, including [[Chrome Alloy]], [[Chrome Buckshot]], [[Chrome Bullet Tip]], [[Spiked Flail]], [[Iron Fire Axe]], [[Steel Fire Axe]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

